#### 6.3 Scene Definition (라인 837)

```typescript
const scenes = {
  // ... other scenes ...
  worksFinal: {},  // ← 라인 837: **NO onProgress, NO onDispose callbacks**
  client: {
    onProgress: (progress: number): void => {
